。开口不用一次说全，先准备一句开头就好。你更想先告诉他“被当众问的尴尬”，还是“回来后的委屈”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2772,"promptTokens":161,"completionTokens":220,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:49:27"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":37,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"e6144e948ce84b8f8790140399eeff51","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608732886353061,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb53759efdd25482151b1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142967352,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:49:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb53759efdd25482151b1","chatId":"6d46b9a2bb0a46c0909585c8b7a81cbe","sessionId":null,"userId":129569,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最难受的是……她当着大家问，我感觉自己像被检查一样。可我当时还笑，回来才觉得特别委屈。这样说出来，好像也没那么丢人。接下来我该怎么跟他开这个口？<第18轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":36,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"e6144e948ce84b8f8790140399eeff51","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608732886353061,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb53759efdd25482151b2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142967349,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:49:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["压抑","委屈","焦虑","自责"],"originalText":["我最近总是心里堵得慌，但真要我说清楚为什么，我又讲不出来。","我挂了电话就特别堵。","我当时就觉得，怎么又是我一个人消化。","我其实很怕生不了，怕最后变成我一个人的问题。"]},"conversation":{"type":"人际关系处理","topic":"家庭生育压力下的夫妻沟通、婆媳关系与亲戚边界处理，以及由此带来的委屈、压抑和焦虑情绪。"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb52f59