。检查结果后的“是不是晚了”很折磨人，先别急着下结论。此刻你最担心的是结果不好，还是担心已经错过时机？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"能试着先跟他商量“电话来了你先接”，说明你在找办法。检查结果后的“是不是晚了”很折磨人，先别急着下结论。此刻你最担心的是结果不好，还是担心已经错过时机？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3436,"promptTokens":149,"completionTokens":383,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:48:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"aae40b65c318487c863590c45986aea3","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020327762129153982,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb51b59efdd2548215110","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142939263,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:48:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb51b59efdd2548215110","chatId":"6d46b9a2bb0a46c0909585c8b7a81cbe","sessionId":null,"userId":129569,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"先跟他商量“电话来了你先接”……这个也许我能试试。但我心里还是绕不开，检查结果出来以后，我总觉得自己是不是已经晚了。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"aae40b65c318487c863590c45986aea3","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020327762129153982,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb51b59efdd2548215111","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142939261,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:48:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["压抑","委屈","焦虑","自责"],"originalText":["我最近总是心里堵得慌，但真要我说清楚为什